  <jpcrp_cor:NotesRegardingGuaranteeObligationsTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearInstant">&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:9pt;"&gt;　3　偶発債務　&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:30pt;"&gt;債権流動化に伴う買戻義務限度額&lt;/p&gt;
