&lt;/table&gt;&lt;p style="clear:both; line-height:0.75pt; width:100%; font-size:0.75pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:NotesRegardingAssetsAndLiabilitiesIncurredFromTransactionsWithAffiliatedEntitiesTextBlock>
  <jpcrp_cor:NotesRegardingGuaranteeObligationsTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_NonConsolidatedMember">&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:9pt;"&gt;　2　偶発債務&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:27pt;"&gt;(1) 借入債務に対する保証&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="tbld" style="margin-left:30.1pt;"&gt;
